  "_telework_caveat": "TELWRKHR and TELWRKPAY begin 2022-10 and are asked only of employed people who worked in the reference week. They are POST-TREATMENT for any employment outcome. Admissible uses: incumbent hours and earnings; subsequent separation on the CPSIDP link; occupation-month telework rates built from OLDER workers. Never as a person-level regressor for a young worker's employment probability."
